# Footsteps ($10) give way to any noise effect already playing and to the
# song's own noise channel. tick 0: footsteps, alone; they play. tick 10: an
# enemy killed ($02); tick 12: footsteps, ignored, and $02 plays on. tick 60:
# song $04 (main caves), whose noise channel is on; tick 120: footsteps,
# ignored. Three seconds.
[sfxRequest_noise=10]
